  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU for Rights and Security &#xbf; MK2024AAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action aims at improving the respect of human rights and strengthen security. In this regard, the following outcomes and outputs are foreseen:Outcomes: (1) enhanced response to gender-based and domestic violence and promotion of the legal housing rights of the Roma people, and (2) strengthened state response to security threats and risks posed by cybercrime, organised crime, terrorism, radicalisation and violent extremism.Outputs: (1.1) improved protection services for victims of gender-based and domestic violence; (1.2) enhanced inter-institutional cooperation at national and local level on gender-based and domestic violence; (1.3) established detailed urban planning for Roma settlements; (2.1) strengthened performance of the police and other law enforcement agencies to investigate and address crime in line with international standards; and (2.2) introduced operational tools for strengthening cybersecurity resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
